&lt;p&gt;II. The members of the commission should be severely punished - &lt;strong&gt;False&lt;/strong&gt; (Because the allegation made by the inhabitants has not been established as true. Therefore, punishment cannot be inferred from the statement.)&lt;/p&gt;

