	&lt;li&gt;The most appropriate meaning of the given phrase &amp;#39;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;In weal and woe&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;#39; is &amp;#39;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;in prosperity and adversity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;#39;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
