&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(The sum of the alphabets positional values) &amp;times; (Number of vowels in word) = Number&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;lsquo;DEVICE&amp;rsquo; is coded as &amp;lsquo;144&amp;rsquo;&lt;/p&gt;

