&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr; Now, the total time to cover the same distance = 2.5 hours&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr; Speed of car = 200&amp;nbsp;&amp;divide; 2.5 = 80 km/h&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Therefore, the speed of a car to cover the same distance in 2.5 hours is 80 km/h.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

