	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Jolt:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;A sudden, strong, and often unexpected jerk or shake. (झटका)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stark:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Complete, harsh, or grim, often used to describe a situation or contrast that is sharp, clear, and without any embellishments. (कठोर)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

