&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Given:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;External dimensions of the box = 10 cm &amp;times; 8 cm &amp;times; 6 cm.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Thickness of the wood = 0.5 cm.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Formula Used:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Volume of the wood required = External volume of the box - Internal volume of the box.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;External volume of the box = Length &amp;times; Breadth &amp;times; Height.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Internal dimensions = (Length - 2&amp;times;Thickness) &amp;times; (Breadth - 2&amp;times;Thickness) &amp;times; (Height - 2&amp;times;Thickness).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Calculation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;External volume = 10 cm &amp;times; 8 cm &amp;times; 6 cm&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr; External volume = 480 cm&lt;sup&gt;3&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Internal dimensions = (10 cm - 2&amp;times;0.5 cm) &amp;times; (8 cm - 2&amp;times;0.5 cm) &amp;times; (6 cm - 2&amp;times;0.5 cm)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr; Internal dimensions = (9 cm &amp;times; 7 cm &amp;times; 5 cm)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr; Internal volume = 9 cm &amp;times; 7 cm &amp;times; 5 cm&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr; Internal volume = 315 cm&lt;sup&gt;3&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Volume of wood required = External volume - Internal volume&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr; Volume of wood required = 480 cm&lt;sup&gt;3&lt;/sup&gt; - 315 cm&lt;sup&gt;3&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr; Volume of wood required = 165 cm&lt;sup&gt;3&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The volume of wood required is 165 cm&lt;sup&gt;3&lt;/sup&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

