en.value:
&lt;p style=&quot;color:  (33, 37, 41);&quot;&gt;In choosing the most suitable&amp;nbsp;solution that HR should consider&amp;nbsp;there are several important factors to consider, which includes :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol style=&quot;color:  (33, 37, 41);&quot;&gt;
